{
 "total": 28.0,
 "planned": false,
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "This animal shimmers like a rainbow.",
   "visual": "hook",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.049
  },
  {
   "text": "But the rainbow isn't its own light.",
   "visual": "hook",
   "start": 2.049,
   "end": 3.937
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a comb jelly.",
   "visual": "notjelly",
   "start": 3.937,
   "end": 5.003
  },
  {
   "text": "And it's not even a jellyfish.",
   "visual": "notjelly",
   "start": 5.003,
   "end": 6.644
  },
  {
   "text": "Along its body are eight rows of tiny hairs, called combs.",
   "visual": "combs",
   "start": 6.644,
   "end": 10.082
  },
  {
   "text": "It beats them in waves to swim.",
   "visual": "swim",
   "start": 10.082,
   "end": 11.97
  },
  {
   "text": "And when light hits the moving combs, it splits into every color.",
   "visual": "split",
   "start": 11.97,
   "end": 15.082
  },
  {
   "text": "The rainbow is just reflected light.",
   "visual": "reflected",
   "start": 15.082,
   "end": 18.103
  },
  {
   "text": "In 2024, scientists saw two injured comb jellies fuse into one.",
   "visual": "fuse",
   "start": 18.103,
   "end": 22.654
  },
  {
   "text": "Within hours, they moved as one animal.",
   "visual": "asone",
   "start": 22.654,
   "end": 25.136
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow BioNiche for more weird animals.",
   "visual": "cta",
   "start": 25.136,
   "end": 28.0
  }
 ],
